WEBVTT

01:40.530 --> 01:44.259
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.039 --> 01:47.229
[Episode 13]

02:21.310 --> 02:22.710
Excuse me, you two.

02:32.960 --> 02:34.000
How rude.

02:34.270 --> 02:35.590
They didn't even greet me.

02:54.870 --> 02:55.700
I'm back.

02:57.270 --> 02:58.150
Thank you for your hard work.

02:58.310 --> 02:59.190
Why don't we invite them over

02:59.190 --> 03:00.470
to have roast goose together?

03:01.530 --> 03:03.250
It wasn't really hard work.

03:03.990 --> 03:06.070
I just couldn't buy any roast goose.

03:07.190 --> 03:08.190
Couldn't get any?

03:08.950 --> 03:10.430
I bought a live goose.

03:10.750 --> 03:12.190
Why don't we roast it ourselves?

03:12.230 --> 03:13.670
How do we roast it?

03:14.790 --> 03:15.630
How to roast it?

03:15.820 --> 03:17.460
Isn't it simple? We use fire to roast it.

03:18.670 --> 03:19.460
Don't run!

03:20.590 --> 03:21.390
Stop running!

03:22.560 --> 03:23.590
Where are you running to?

03:25.180 --> 03:25.710
Still running?

03:25.710 --> 03:27.150
I thought you were really capable.

03:27.150 --> 03:28.990
Didn't expect that you can't even catch a goose.

03:30.510 --> 03:31.550
Isn't this what you said?

03:31.550 --> 03:33.240
A big goose tastes better when stewed whole.

03:33.240 --> 03:34.120
If I hack it down,

03:34.120 --> 03:35.590
won't it become dumpling filling,

03:35.630 --> 03:36.670
with feathers and all?

03:36.670 --> 03:37.670
We can't eat that!

03:38.350 --> 03:39.990
Alright then, carry on.

03:41.070 --> 03:42.070
What are you doing?

03:42.750 --> 03:43.510
Don't run!

03:43.510 --> 03:44.680
I want to eat roast goose.

03:44.829 --> 03:46.350
Zi Fei is negotiating with it.

03:47.700 --> 03:48.870
The goose is charging at you!

03:57.750 --> 03:58.630
It scared me.

04:02.790 --> 04:03.790
Your legs have healed?

04:11.710 --> 04:12.830
They really have healed.

04:17.220 --> 04:18.589
You agreed I could leave or stay as you please.

04:19.050 --> 04:20.550
You can't go back on your word.

04:29.130 --> 04:30.560
You're so despicable.

04:30.750 --> 04:31.990
Just to catch a goose,

04:32.010 --> 04:33.720
you even used the Divine Left Hand.

04:34.390 --> 04:35.190
Its disadvantage is

04:35.190 --> 04:36.260
it can't speak.

04:36.260 --> 04:37.909
Otherwise, it would have cursed you already.

04:37.990 --> 04:38.710
Zi Fei has already

04:38.710 --> 04:39.909
negotiated with it.

04:39.909 --> 04:41.950
It's just that the goose didn't agree.

04:43.150 --> 04:44.430
Can this even be negotiated?

04:46.030 --> 04:47.060
When I was coming up the mountain earlier,

04:47.060 --> 04:48.350
I met two scholars.

04:48.510 --> 04:49.230
I originally wanted to ask

04:49.230 --> 04:50.110
where to buy roast goose.

04:50.110 --> 04:50.710
But those two

04:50.710 --> 04:51.870
completely ignored me.

04:52.530 --> 04:53.340
Oh, right.

04:53.590 --> 04:54.740
Those two have already gone up the mountain.

04:54.740 --> 04:55.790
Did you see them?

04:59.590 --> 05:00.600
I saw them.

05:01.350 --> 05:02.550
But they weren't living people.

05:02.550 --> 05:03.430
Those were images

05:03.430 --> 05:04.590
of what happened here before.

05:05.000 --> 05:05.790
Images?

05:06.350 --> 05:07.750
On Baitou Mountain, there's a kind of

05:07.750 --> 05:08.940
special restriction.

05:09.550 --> 05:11.350
Whenever the mist spreads,

05:11.710 --> 05:13.500
it records fragments of images

05:13.500 --> 05:14.830
from that time.

05:15.430 --> 05:16.950
The images are suddenly released

05:16.950 --> 05:18.470
when there's thunder and lightning.

05:19.310 --> 05:21.620
People walking, lying down, laughing, and arguing…

05:21.790 --> 05:23.110
They're all lifelike.

05:23.510 --> 05:24.360
What were those scholars

05:24.360 --> 05:25.990
doing on Baitou Mountain?

05:26.350 --> 05:27.560
Because this used to be

05:27.560 --> 05:28.750
a very famous academy.

05:28.750 --> 05:29.590
Those who came here

05:29.590 --> 05:31.060
were all students seeking knowledge.

05:32.950 --> 05:34.470
How do you know all this so clearly?

05:34.630 --> 05:36.230
I used to study here too.

05:36.710 --> 05:37.420
I've been here

05:37.420 --> 05:38.670
for 60 years.

05:38.670 --> 05:39.990
How come I've never seen you before?

05:42.150 --> 05:42.990
That was

05:42.990 --> 05:44.430
a long time ago.

05:44.510 --> 05:45.670
A long time ago?

05:48.060 --> 05:48.870
How old are you?

06:02.830 --> 06:04.390
Send this letter back to the clan.

06:04.590 --> 06:05.750
Have Baili Xiang investigate

06:05.840 --> 06:06.950
when Baitou Mountain ever had

06:06.950 --> 06:07.950
such an academy,

06:08.110 --> 06:08.910
who taught there,

06:08.910 --> 06:10.360
and what students were educated there.

06:10.470 --> 06:12.150
Will Baili Xiang listen to you?

06:12.870 --> 06:13.750
He's eager

06:13.750 --> 06:15.230
to do something for me now.

06:15.380 --> 06:16.590
Just go ahead and send it back.

06:16.630 --> 06:18.430
Alright, that's easy. I'll take care of it.

07:33.390 --> 07:34.070
Have we

07:34.070 --> 07:35.430
known each other for a long time?

07:45.510 --> 07:46.750
Sir, your tea.

07:46.750 --> 07:47.470
Please enjoy.

07:47.470 --> 07:48.190
Thank you.

08:07.350 --> 08:08.350
This is the Juque Sword.

08:11.950 --> 08:12.750
Yes.

08:13.150 --> 08:14.420
Why did you have it?

08:16.070 --> 08:17.000
I found it.

08:18.510 --> 08:19.750
Why were you looking for it?

08:27.190 --> 08:29.550
It has saved me many times over the years.

08:30.110 --> 08:31.430
It's truly a fine sword.

08:32.510 --> 08:33.179
But it's not as

08:33.179 --> 08:34.390
powerful as you said.

08:35.070 --> 08:36.230
It's just sharp, that's all.

08:38.669 --> 08:39.750
Why are you giving it to me?

08:40.510 --> 08:41.710
It was meant for you in the first place.

08:54.710 --> 08:55.840
Who are you really?

08:56.910 --> 08:57.910
Sixty years ago,

08:58.900 --> 09:02.000
at the foot of Guizang Mountain in Yaoguang County, Baicheng Prefecture,

09:03.060 --> 09:04.580
I saw you for the first time.

09:11.030 --> 09:12.430
I was 17 that year.

09:13.270 --> 09:14.670
Thinking my saber skills were perfected,

09:14.830 --> 09:16.300
I left home to wander the martial world.

09:17.550 --> 09:18.430
I was determined to find

09:18.430 --> 09:19.790
an equally matched opponent.

09:21.670 --> 09:22.510
Unexpectedly,

09:23.240 --> 09:24.910
I was defeated by you in one move.

09:26.950 --> 09:27.990
I was furious,

09:28.080 --> 09:29.190
so I clung to you.

09:30.650 --> 09:32.210
I was truly ignorant of my own limitations.

09:33.590 --> 09:34.750
This is really delicious.

09:34.750 --> 09:35.470
Try some.

09:35.790 --> 09:36.590
I'll try some.

09:41.260 --> 09:42.600
Miss, your tea.

09:46.750 --> 09:47.550
Enjoy.

09:48.150 --> 09:48.950
Thank you.

09:55.070 --> 09:56.590
Later, at the estate in Minzhou,

09:56.990 --> 09:58.190
I found you again.

09:59.550 --> 10:00.510
You were injured,

10:00.670 --> 10:01.870
lying on the riverbank.

10:03.150 --> 10:04.670
It snowed heavily that day.

10:05.110 --> 10:07.360
My saber was frozen cold.

10:12.670 --> 10:14.030
But I saw you again.

10:14.870 --> 10:15.870
I was very happy.

10:45.470 --> 10:46.150
I took you

10:46.150 --> 10:47.550
to a nearby estate to recover.

10:48.460 --> 10:49.630
You acknowledged my kindness

10:50.270 --> 10:52.710
and taught me saber techniques in your spare time.

10:53.390 --> 10:54.950
Although you weren't talkative,

10:55.670 --> 10:56.910
I was truly happy

10:57.550 --> 10:58.960
during that time.

11:01.670 --> 11:03.950
Your wounds healed day by day.

11:04.990 --> 11:06.190
I knew you would leave,

11:07.350 --> 11:08.870
but I didn't expect it to be so soon.

11:18.710 --> 11:20.310
I didn't know where to find you.

11:21.030 --> 11:21.910
I didn't even know

11:21.910 --> 11:22.840
your name.

11:23.900 --> 11:25.270
I only knew about this sword.

11:25.830 --> 11:26.630
I knew

11:27.910 --> 11:29.310
you needed to find this sword.

11:30.430 --> 11:31.830
I went to many places

11:31.990 --> 11:33.110
and searched for many years.

11:34.510 --> 11:36.070
I finally found this sword.

11:37.950 --> 11:38.710
But I didn't know

11:38.710 --> 11:39.910
how to give it to you.

11:40.710 --> 11:42.030
So I went to look for you again.

11:45.550 --> 11:46.830
Time flew by so fast.

11:47.820 --> 11:49.240
When I saw you again,

11:50.420 --> 11:52.260
more than 20 years had passed.

12:03.470 --> 12:04.550
Only then did I realize

12:04.790 --> 12:07.350
that the one I liked was an immortal.

12:08.550 --> 12:09.510
No wonder he could

12:09.510 --> 12:10.830
break through my saber technique with one sword strike.

12:11.510 --> 12:12.550
No wonder his wounds

12:12.630 --> 12:14.190
healed so quickly.

12:15.320 --> 12:16.990
It turned out he wasn't human.

12:21.270 --> 12:22.150
It made sense.

12:23.950 --> 12:25.440
It was such a simple thing,

12:25.750 --> 12:27.110
yet it took me so many years

12:27.110 --> 12:28.350
to understand.

12:29.510 --> 12:30.790
I'm so stupid.

12:31.630 --> 12:33.430
Why didn't you call out to me back then?

12:34.230 --> 12:36.270
I've heard that the immortals of the Youhu Clan

12:36.390 --> 12:37.470
have long lifespans.

12:38.070 --> 12:39.950
Even without practicing any immortal techniques,

12:40.350 --> 12:41.140
they can easily

12:41.140 --> 12:42.550
live for several hundred years.

12:43.230 --> 12:44.540
You're in your prime, Sir.

12:45.670 --> 12:46.710
You probably don't know

12:46.800 --> 12:48.240
what aging is like.

12:51.710 --> 12:52.710
It's like

12:54.070 --> 12:55.270
teeth falling out,

12:55.750 --> 12:56.940
skin sagging,

12:57.950 --> 13:00.320
ears going deaf, eyes blurring, and back hunching,

13:01.030 --> 13:04.350
gradually losing the sense of taste,

13:04.590 --> 13:05.910
unable to distinguish near from far,

13:06.550 --> 13:08.240
memory slowly fading.

13:09.240 --> 13:11.310
and unable to lift a knife or hold a sword anymore.

13:11.860 --> 13:13.390
Every breath will feel

13:14.110 --> 13:15.030
like there's a huge rock

13:15.030 --> 13:16.720
pressing on your chest.

13:18.110 --> 13:20.150
Every moment, you can feel

13:20.150 --> 13:22.350
your body dying.

13:27.430 --> 13:28.550
You don't know, do you?

13:29.390 --> 13:30.550
This is aging.

13:31.390 --> 13:32.590
It's irreversible,

13:33.000 --> 13:35.990
growing older day by day.

13:38.550 --> 13:39.990
I know everyone is different.

13:40.630 --> 13:42.310
The divine race rules the Six Realms,

13:43.310 --> 13:45.270
the War Demons are stronger than the Youhu Clan,

13:45.510 --> 13:47.710
and the Youhu Clan lives longer than humans.

13:47.830 --> 13:48.550
But we humans

13:48.550 --> 13:49.990
are not entirely useless.

13:50.390 --> 13:51.310
We are numerous

13:51.630 --> 13:52.750
and can reproduce more easily.

13:53.070 --> 13:53.830
We are intelligent

13:53.830 --> 13:54.980
with dexterous hands.

13:55.430 --> 13:57.030
Compared to livestock and wild beasts,

13:57.070 --> 13:58.430
we are much stronger.

13:58.820 --> 14:00.030
Many humans

14:00.150 --> 14:02.110
envy the divine race's longevity

14:02.350 --> 14:04.710
and the immortal race's ability to fly and traverse the earth.

14:05.270 --> 14:06.310
But I didn't.

14:07.190 --> 14:08.550
I thought I was detached

14:08.870 --> 14:10.060
and clear-headed,

14:11.380 --> 14:12.630
but at that moment,

14:13.740 --> 14:15.670
the moment I saw you again,

14:17.470 --> 14:18.390
I suddenly felt an overwhelming

14:18.390 --> 14:19.430
hatred for myself.

14:21.080 --> 14:22.910
I hated being human,

14:23.630 --> 14:25.630
hated being so old and ugly,

14:25.830 --> 14:27.360
hated my foolish delusions,

14:27.360 --> 14:28.430
and my overestimation of myself.

14:29.350 --> 14:31.110
Can you understand this feeling?

14:34.350 --> 14:35.550
I couldn't face you.

14:36.030 --> 14:37.430
I didn't dare to face you,

14:38.430 --> 14:39.740
but I didn't want to leave either.

14:40.750 --> 14:42.270
I found a town at the foot of the mountain

14:42.270 --> 14:43.270
and settled down there.

14:44.230 --> 14:45.710
It was next to Fangwai Mountain.

14:46.150 --> 14:47.630
Occasionally, you would come down,

14:48.070 --> 14:49.430
sometimes alone,

14:49.430 --> 14:50.790
sometimes with attendants.

14:51.510 --> 14:53.110
I knew you were doing well.

14:53.790 --> 14:54.510
Time passed,

14:54.510 --> 14:55.790
day by day.

14:56.630 --> 14:57.950
You never changed,

14:58.100 --> 14:58.900
but I...

14:59.990 --> 15:01.470
I was about to die.

15:00.420 --> 15:03.510
♫I gaze into your deep eyes♫

15:04.900 --> 15:08.730
♫For whom do you take apart the word "love"?♫

15:06.150 --> 15:07.910
Ten years ago, when my time was almost up,

15:08.310 --> 15:09.670
I wanted to go home one last time.

15:11.010 --> 15:12.510
On the way, I encountered heavy rain

15:11.260 --> 15:14.230
♫Turning around, it's like a dream♫

15:13.070 --> 15:14.510
and found a temple

15:14.630 --> 15:15.620
to take shelter.

15:15.660 --> 15:20.000
♫I have betrayed deep love♫

15:22.040 --> 15:24.430
People say the gods have disappeared,

15:22.100 --> 15:25.230
♫Heaving a long, helpless sigh♫

15:26.230 --> 15:27.070
but when I saw

15:26.700 --> 15:30.180
♫Time flies too rapidly♫

15:27.070 --> 15:28.470
that statue of the goddess,

15:29.590 --> 15:31.230
I felt she was alive.

15:32.750 --> 15:33.550
So,

15:32.870 --> 15:36.230
♫Life is like a flying bird♫

15:34.710 --> 15:35.950
I asked her a question.

15:37.160 --> 15:42.550
♫Joining, scattering, no way back♫

15:37.510 --> 15:38.320
The question

15:38.910 --> 15:39.710
was…

15:40.350 --> 15:41.150
I asked her,

15:42.110 --> 15:43.630
"They say gods love all beings,

15:43.220 --> 15:46.670
♫Unable to get what I yearn for, I sink in sadness♫

15:44.830 --> 15:46.710
but why aren't all beings equal?"

15:47.070 --> 15:48.120
Did she answer you?

15:48.780 --> 15:52.170
♫When I brush past love, fate is set♫

15:48.830 --> 15:50.730
Yes, she did.

15:51.350 --> 15:52.230
What did she say?

15:53.690 --> 15:56.080
♫I've used up my brush and ink♫

15:55.230 --> 15:56.150
She asked me...

15:56.750 --> 15:58.830
♫I couldn't describe♫

15:58.270 --> 16:00.270
"Do you want to change all this?"

15:59.400 --> 16:04.120
♫This lovesick path with you♫

16:04.330 --> 16:06.340
♫After the farewell, where are you now?♫

16:06.380 --> 16:09.270
♫Who do you spend your days with?♫

16:06.390 --> 16:07.430
That beam of light

16:07.550 --> 16:08.940
gradually enveloped me.

16:09.590 --> 16:11.390
I regained my former youth.

16:09.900 --> 16:14.360
♫Do you know I'm willing to wait for you until the end?♫

16:12.630 --> 16:15.350
Later, I went to Fangwai Mountain.

16:15.470 --> 16:18.270
♫Sighing that the world is too lonely♫

16:16.260 --> 16:18.350
After that, nothing else mattered.

16:18.420 --> 16:20.740
♫They laugh at me for being foolish♫

16:20.900 --> 16:21.630
What I want to say

16:21.270 --> 16:25.690
♫Longing is in my song; the people are not as before♫

16:21.630 --> 16:22.880
has all been said.

16:23.760 --> 16:24.870
I use a saber,

16:25.270 --> 16:27.190
so I'll leave this sword to you.

16:26.830 --> 16:30.840
♫Can't get what I yearn for, I sink in sadness♫

16:28.470 --> 16:29.460
Since you went up the mountain,

16:29.830 --> 16:30.950
why didn't you come to see me?

16:31.780 --> 16:33.270
Were you very disappointed in me?

16:32.380 --> 16:36.340
♫When I brush past love fate is set♫

16:34.190 --> 16:35.790
You never promised me anything.

16:36.790 --> 16:38.950
You're an immortal with a long lifespan.

16:37.340 --> 16:40.190
♫I've used up my brush and ink♫

16:39.260 --> 16:40.030
So many people

16:40.030 --> 16:41.270
have passed through your life.

16:40.540 --> 16:42.940
♫I couldn't describe♫

16:41.510 --> 16:42.910
You can't possibly remember them all.

16:43.110 --> 16:44.030
It's not your fault.

16:43.270 --> 16:47.890
♫This lovesick path with you♫

16:45.150 --> 16:46.550
But I wasted my entire life,

16:47.230 --> 16:48.390
being just an insignificant passerby

16:48.200 --> 16:50.110
♫After the farewell, where are you now?♫

16:48.390 --> 16:50.070
in your life.

16:50.130 --> 16:52.840
♫Who do you spend your days with?♫

16:50.750 --> 16:52.110
I neglected my family and friends,

16:52.430 --> 16:53.550
and neglected myself too.

16:53.160 --> 16:58.610
♫Do you know I'm willing to wait for you until the end?♫

16:55.020 --> 16:55.790
I was just

16:55.790 --> 16:57.110
disappointed in myself, that's all.

16:58.230 --> 16:59.710
Fortunately, I received divine favor

16:59.250 --> 17:01.750
♫Sighing that the world is too lonely♫

16:59.790 --> 17:00.840
and regained my youth.

17:01.470 --> 17:02.510
I still have time.

17:02.000 --> 17:04.730
♫They laugh at me for being foolish♫

17:04.970 --> 17:09.450
♫Longing is in my song; the people are not as before♫

17:10.579 --> 17:11.500
I'm leaving.

17:10.710 --> 17:14.569
♫Can't get what I yearn for, I sink in sadness♫

17:11.940 --> 17:13.869
Sir, take care.

17:15.940 --> 17:20.349
♫When I brush past love, fate is set♫

17:19.230 --> 17:20.150
You too.

17:20.829 --> 17:23.030
♫I've used up my brush and ink♫

17:23.520 --> 17:26.670
♫But I can't describe♫

17:27.109 --> 17:30.790
♫This lovesick path♫

17:31.660 --> 17:40.420
♫People are not as they were in this lifetime♫

18:32.510 --> 18:33.710
Master, Master!

18:34.830 --> 18:36.220
You've come to disturb me again.

20:13.510 --> 20:14.670
What are you doing here?

20:16.870 --> 20:18.830
This is a memory lamp made by Lei Shi.

20:19.100 --> 20:19.790
It can release

20:19.790 --> 20:20.440
images of what

20:20.440 --> 20:21.590
happened here before.

20:22.110 --> 20:24.670
I suspect the formation's core is here.

20:24.670 --> 20:25.350
Look.

20:33.700 --> 20:34.540
Let's go in and take a look.

20:49.710 --> 20:52.430
[Human Race, Xie You]

21:07.790 --> 21:08.590
What's wrong?

21:11.160 --> 21:11.950
The lamp went out.

21:12.070 --> 21:12.950
Just now, we walked

21:12.950 --> 21:14.190
too slowly,

21:14.240 --> 21:15.910
so for a long time,

21:15.910 --> 21:17.190
there wasn't enough friction to power it.

21:17.520 --> 21:18.910
It automatically turned off.

21:22.710 --> 21:23.500
See,

21:23.940 --> 21:25.060
it's lit up again, isn't it?

21:30.680 --> 21:31.480
Are you scared?

21:32.510 --> 21:33.310
Don't be ridiculous.

21:33.350 --> 21:34.580
What do I have to be afraid of?

21:57.070 --> 21:58.110
This is called the Thousand Mechanism Door,

21:58.110 --> 21:59.190
also known as the Eight Trigrams Door.

21:59.310 --> 21:59.950
The bricks

21:59.950 --> 22:01.630
are the key to opening this door.

22:01.710 --> 22:02.910
Only by correctly arranging

22:02.910 --> 22:03.790
all the bricks on it

22:03.790 --> 22:05.470
can this door be opened.

22:06.510 --> 22:07.750
Do you have a way to open it?

22:07.750 --> 22:08.510
Of course.

22:30.070 --> 22:31.590
If you have the way to open the door,

22:31.740 --> 22:33.110
why didn't you say so earlier?

22:33.790 --> 22:35.190
I saw you studying it for a while,

22:35.190 --> 22:36.430
so I thought you knew.

22:41.110 --> 22:41.910
Let's go in.

23:25.550 --> 23:26.430
What is this?

23:27.790 --> 23:29.030
This is a test.

23:29.500 --> 23:30.530
It asks for a pattern.

23:30.830 --> 23:32.830
Its size should be equal to a given circle.

23:33.430 --> 23:35.270
You seem quite familiar with this place.

23:35.590 --> 23:37.350
I used to study here in the past.

23:37.550 --> 23:39.270
Before officially entering the mountain to become a student,

23:39.270 --> 23:40.550
I was tested here.

23:40.830 --> 23:41.870
This is the first question.

23:42.470 --> 23:43.950
If I'm not mistaken,

23:43.990 --> 23:45.270
the restriction on Baitou Mountain

23:45.330 --> 23:46.930
should have been set by my master.

23:48.510 --> 23:50.020
This restriction is quite powerful.

23:50.050 --> 23:51.530
The spellcasting is also extremely sophisticated.

23:51.750 --> 23:53.430
Even I can't break it immediately.

23:53.590 --> 23:55.230
Your master is this skilled?

23:55.260 --> 23:56.260
Of course.

23:56.400 --> 23:57.800
My master is incredibly powerful.

23:58.000 --> 23:59.920
He knew everything, from astronomy to geography.

23:59.990 --> 24:01.190
These restrictions are nothing

24:01.190 --> 24:02.470
to him at all.

24:04.310 --> 24:05.630
I can't tell at all.

24:06.000 --> 24:07.870
Then please take a closer look.

24:13.990 --> 24:15.190
Why did this door close?

24:15.860 --> 24:16.670
It's alright.

24:16.830 --> 24:17.910
As long as we answer the question correctly,

24:17.950 --> 24:19.200
it will open automatically.

24:19.200 --> 24:19.750
We can then

24:19.750 --> 24:21.030
directly enter to the next level.

24:21.190 --> 24:22.510
What if we can't answer it?

24:22.870 --> 24:24.550
That door will appear again,

24:24.550 --> 24:26.630
but it won't lead to the second level.

24:26.710 --> 24:28.070
Instead, it will take us back to the starting point.

24:28.880 --> 24:29.670
So,

24:30.230 --> 24:31.150
this door will lead to different places

24:31.150 --> 24:32.400
based on the results

24:32.630 --> 24:34.030
of the test?

24:34.110 --> 24:35.060
That's right.

24:53.910 --> 24:54.960
You can't solve it?

24:55.790 --> 24:56.590
I can.

24:56.740 --> 24:57.860
You can ask me.

25:31.350 --> 25:32.150
Yuanzhong!

25:39.540 --> 25:40.340
Hallucination?

25:41.790 --> 25:42.580
Yuanzhong.

25:43.670 --> 25:44.910
Are you afraid?

25:45.680 --> 25:46.750
Whether you succeed or fail,

25:46.950 --> 25:48.710
you are a hero of our clan.

25:48.990 --> 25:49.790
But if you run,

25:50.700 --> 25:51.670
you will die.

26:00.840 --> 26:01.760
How could this happen?

26:03.030 --> 26:03.870
Will you go voluntarily,

26:03.870 --> 26:05.550
or should I have someone help you?

26:06.710 --> 26:07.430
Guards!

26:07.430 --> 26:08.350
-Yes.
-Yes.

26:09.540 --> 26:10.350
Let me go!

26:11.270 --> 26:12.070
Let go!

26:12.510 --> 26:13.350
Let me go!

26:16.630 --> 26:18.740
Father, save me!

26:21.030 --> 26:22.300
Who dares to hurt my son?

26:23.550 --> 26:24.350
Dingxu,

26:24.710 --> 26:27.230
you're tyrannical and cruel to your own people.

26:27.670 --> 26:28.990
You have no ability yourself,

26:29.190 --> 26:30.990
so you force these children to go to their deaths.

26:31.630 --> 26:33.350
You're utterly shameless.

26:33.550 --> 26:34.540
What I'm doing

26:35.060 --> 26:36.910
is all for the Youhu Clan.

26:37.750 --> 26:39.480
Now, the War Demons are unstoppable,

26:39.480 --> 26:40.950
our clan is in grave danger.

26:41.230 --> 26:43.150
If we can't obtain the Divine Left Hand,

26:43.150 --> 26:44.270
our clan will eventually be destroyed

26:44.270 --> 26:45.510
by the War Demons.

26:45.910 --> 26:47.310
Rather than waiting for slaughter,

26:47.670 --> 26:49.020
we might as well take a chance.

26:49.070 --> 26:50.780
If you want to take a chance, you or I can go.

26:51.110 --> 26:52.390
We can't gamble with these

26:52.390 --> 26:53.110
children's lives.

26:53.990 --> 26:55.270
You're so stubborn.

26:56.350 --> 26:57.140
Seize him!

27:06.750 --> 27:08.870
Yuanzhong, come with me.

27:10.230 --> 27:12.390
Yuanzhong, if you leave,

27:12.630 --> 27:13.310
have you thought about

27:13.310 --> 27:15.030
what will happen to your clansmen?

27:15.630 --> 27:18.030
If you can't learn to use the Divine Left Hand,

27:18.350 --> 27:19.640
your family and friends,

27:20.470 --> 27:21.270
your clansmen,

27:21.710 --> 27:22.910
will all die horribly

27:22.910 --> 27:24.570
under the blades of the War Demons.

27:24.950 --> 27:26.270
You can escape now,

27:26.670 --> 27:28.030
but how long can you escape for?

27:28.300 --> 27:29.750
And how far can you go?

27:30.950 --> 27:32.580
Are you going to wait until they're all dead

27:33.430 --> 27:35.790
to regret your choice today?

27:36.670 --> 27:38.310
You can save them,

27:38.990 --> 27:39.790
can't you?

27:40.260 --> 27:41.510
Don't listen to his nonsense.

27:43.310 --> 27:45.230
Even if you learn to use the Divine Left Hand,

27:45.350 --> 27:46.350
what then?

27:46.580 --> 27:49.070
After killing all the War Demons and saving the entire clan,

27:49.380 --> 27:50.980
they'll have no more worries.

27:51.670 --> 27:53.110
Do you think they'll trust you

27:53.510 --> 27:54.710
to possess the powerful force

27:54.710 --> 27:56.030
of Divine Left Hand?

27:58.510 --> 27:59.750
When the birds are gone, the bow is put away.

28:00.530 --> 28:01.810
When the hare is caught, the hound is cooked.

28:02.470 --> 28:03.270
When the time comes,

28:03.830 --> 28:05.670
they'll scheme against you despicably.

28:05.750 --> 28:06.660
They'll seal you away,

28:06.770 --> 28:08.290
keep you under house arrest,

28:08.310 --> 28:09.430
and subject you to endless humiliation.

28:11.190 --> 28:12.350
Will you regret it?

28:14.070 --> 28:14.880
Yuanzhong,

28:15.390 --> 28:16.430
no matter what,

28:16.640 --> 28:18.220
they are your brethren,

28:18.550 --> 28:20.270
connected to you by blood.

28:25.230 --> 28:26.030
Come.

28:28.090 --> 28:28.920
Come with Father.

28:50.950 --> 28:51.710
I've finished answering.

28:51.710 --> 28:52.950
Let's go to the next level.

28:56.110 --> 28:56.910
Yuanzhong.

29:00.830 --> 29:01.640
Oh no.

29:24.800 --> 29:25.850
Wake up, Yuanzhong.

29:26.070 --> 29:27.180
You're in a hallucination.

29:31.480 --> 29:32.270
A hallucination?

29:32.540 --> 29:33.350
Yes.

29:36.670 --> 29:38.390
You're not fighting against anyone

29:38.750 --> 29:40.550
but the fear deep inside your heart.

29:40.770 --> 29:42.460
The past cannot be changed.

29:42.700 --> 29:43.750
Whether right or wrong,

29:43.750 --> 29:45.300
it was your own choice.

29:45.630 --> 29:46.670
Since you've chosen it,

29:46.840 --> 29:48.290
you must face it bravely.

29:48.820 --> 29:50.190
Escaping is useless.

30:03.150 --> 30:04.750
The hallucination looked quite real.

30:04.750 --> 30:05.310
Of course.

30:05.310 --> 30:06.620
Otherwise, how could it deceive people?

30:14.710 --> 30:15.830
What's this crappy painting?

30:16.390 --> 30:17.470
It's the "Angry-Eyed Demon."

30:17.540 --> 30:19.190
This should be my master's work.

30:19.870 --> 30:20.990
How can it forcibly

30:20.990 --> 30:21.960
pull people into a hallucination?

30:22.470 --> 30:23.630
The demon's eyes

30:23.630 --> 30:24.310
are probably made of

30:24.310 --> 30:25.870
a very simple restriction.

30:26.110 --> 30:27.310
It makes people unconsciously

30:27.310 --> 30:28.100
think of

30:28.100 --> 30:29.440
what they least want to remember,

30:29.440 --> 30:31.030
mainly fears and desires.

30:35.850 --> 30:36.730
What are you doing?

30:37.430 --> 30:38.470
Tearing it up, of course.

30:38.670 --> 30:39.430
Should I leave it here

30:39.430 --> 30:40.430
to harm others?

30:40.430 --> 30:40.910
This is my master's

30:40.910 --> 30:42.270
tool to test disciples.

30:42.630 --> 30:44.190
Although it traps people in hallucinations,

30:44.190 --> 30:45.190
it's not fatal.

30:45.230 --> 30:46.550
At worst, they'll fall into a deep sleep.

30:46.550 --> 30:47.750
You can't destroy it.

30:58.280 --> 31:00.110
What did you see in this painting?

31:01.030 --> 31:02.270
I haven't looked at the painting.

31:03.630 --> 31:04.910
I came here to solve the puzzle.

31:04.910 --> 31:06.470
I don't have time to appreciate art.

31:08.230 --> 31:09.030
Finished answering?

31:09.070 --> 31:09.870
Yes, finished.

31:10.160 --> 31:11.670
We can go directly to the second level now.

31:13.310 --> 31:14.100
Old man,

31:14.390 --> 31:16.110
let's see who's really got the skills.

31:16.360 --> 31:17.680
Zi Fei, beat him up.

31:28.430 --> 31:29.750
You old geezer,

31:30.070 --> 31:30.990
haven't seen you in so many years.

31:30.990 --> 31:32.580
I thought you were long dead.

31:33.310 --> 31:33.950
Quick question,

31:33.950 --> 31:34.990
have you picked out your grave yet?

31:34.990 --> 31:35.750
Did you see

31:35.750 --> 31:36.540
this auspicious spot of mine

31:36.540 --> 31:37.590
and want to die here?

31:37.590 --> 31:39.110
I'll grant your wish today.

31:39.470 --> 31:40.270
Mei Shan.

31:50.940 --> 31:51.790
Master!

31:59.830 --> 32:00.990
What's the background

32:00.990 --> 32:02.230
of Ji Tanyin's master?

32:02.230 --> 32:03.030
I don't know.

32:03.590 --> 32:04.400
Didn't you

32:04.400 --> 32:05.430
fight with him before?

32:05.430 --> 32:06.980
You must know something about him.

32:08.220 --> 32:09.660
Yes, I do know something,

32:09.790 --> 32:10.590
but

32:10.740 --> 32:12.110
my knowledge is very limited.

32:13.950 --> 32:15.150
Tell me about it.

32:16.790 --> 32:18.430
Back then, Kai Shan chose this place

32:18.430 --> 32:19.430
to seal himself.

32:19.470 --> 32:20.470
I was entrusted by Yuanzhong

32:20.470 --> 32:22.070
to come here and protect Kai Shan.

32:22.230 --> 32:23.670
But I had only been here for a few days

32:23.670 --> 32:25.630
when this old guy suddenly showed up.

32:25.630 --> 32:27.310
He attacked me without a word.

32:27.350 --> 32:29.110
With my temper, how could I tolerate that?

32:29.390 --> 32:30.990
So you drove him away?

32:32.640 --> 32:35.010
I was the one who got driven away.

32:38.750 --> 32:40.390
But I fought my way back later.

32:40.870 --> 32:41.790
I have to say,

32:41.900 --> 32:43.260
that old guy's swordsmanship

32:43.290 --> 32:44.940
was truly terrifying.

32:45.070 --> 32:46.910
I was fortunate enough to break through my limitations,

32:46.950 --> 32:48.470
and a big part of the reason

32:48.470 --> 32:50.430
was because I defeated him

32:50.450 --> 32:52.060
and got rid of that frustration.

32:52.600 --> 32:54.110
Later, I fought with him for several years.

32:54.150 --> 32:55.230
I had a sudden enlightenment.

32:55.260 --> 32:57.290
When I faced the heavenly tribulation after that,

32:57.320 --> 32:58.510
I obtained divine abilities.

32:58.830 --> 33:01.260
My own cultivation also greatly increased.

33:01.950 --> 33:02.750
So...

33:03.630 --> 33:05.020
You defeated him!

33:05.790 --> 33:06.590
No.

33:07.430 --> 33:08.910
But if you think about it, I didn't lose either.

33:09.390 --> 33:10.310
This seems to have had quite an impact

33:10.310 --> 33:10.870
on that old fellow.

33:10.870 --> 33:12.110
He never came back after that.

33:12.990 --> 33:14.510
Then why do you seem

33:14.740 --> 33:16.870
so resentful whenever you see him?

33:16.870 --> 33:18.470
Because he looks down on me.

33:21.070 --> 33:22.500
Now that you mention it,

33:22.550 --> 33:23.430
I feel like he seems to

33:23.430 --> 33:24.670
look down on me too.

33:25.400 --> 33:26.920
He does look down on you.

33:27.110 --> 33:27.910
Where's Yuanzhong?

33:28.630 --> 33:29.670
He went back to his room to sleep.

33:30.470 --> 33:31.300
Ji Tanyin has gone off

33:31.300 --> 33:32.510
to curry favor with someone else.

33:32.510 --> 33:33.630
How can he still sleep?

34:17.670 --> 34:18.469
Have some water.

34:26.150 --> 34:27.909
Ji Tanyin and her master

34:27.909 --> 34:29.170
talked all night.

34:31.310 --> 34:32.830
The master and student reunited.

34:32.830 --> 34:35.550
It's normal to have a long conversation by candlelight, isn't it?

34:35.630 --> 34:37.469
Although it's a master-student relationship,

34:38.150 --> 34:41.110
they're still a man and woman alone together.

34:51.070 --> 34:52.960
I want to eat milk cake for breakfast.

34:55.500 --> 34:56.270
You know

34:56.270 --> 34:57.590
I only know how to make soy milk.

34:57.590 --> 34:58.830
Would soy milk and steamed buns be okay?

34:59.390 --> 35:00.880
I also want to eat lotus flower with blood duck

35:01.130 --> 35:02.130
and drink soft-shelled turtle soup.

35:02.910 --> 35:04.230
I don't know how to make those either.

35:04.630 --> 35:05.750
Ji Tanyin can make them.

35:06.170 --> 35:06.970
Go ask her.

35:07.430 --> 35:09.230
Are you sure she can?

35:09.390 --> 35:10.860
She's a quick learner.

35:25.670 --> 35:26.470
Master.

35:27.350 --> 35:28.150
I don't dare to accept such a title.

35:28.740 --> 35:30.330
You are already a god.

35:30.410 --> 35:31.730
while I am just a mortal.

35:32.150 --> 35:33.350
I can't be your master anymore.

35:35.320 --> 35:37.500
Once a master, always a master.

35:38.070 --> 35:38.990
I will always remember

35:38.990 --> 35:40.430
the kindness of your teachings.

35:40.910 --> 35:41.670
The reason I have

35:41.670 --> 35:42.990
achieved what I have today

35:42.990 --> 35:43.510
is all because of

35:43.510 --> 35:45.060
your constant guidance

35:45.080 --> 35:46.140
and generous teachings.

35:46.390 --> 35:47.470
Without your kindness,

35:47.490 --> 35:48.930
how can I be where I am today?

35:55.590 --> 35:57.350
Are you angry with me, Master?

36:02.510 --> 36:05.660
I left without saying goodbye back then.

36:06.800 --> 36:08.240
It was indeed my fault.

36:08.710 --> 36:09.590
It was because…

36:14.390 --> 36:15.430
Because the process

36:15.430 --> 36:16.690
was just too sudden.

36:16.710 --> 36:18.100
I ascended to heaven in an instant.

36:18.270 --> 36:18.910
I really

36:18.910 --> 36:20.230
had no preparation at all.

36:20.630 --> 36:22.230
You know me, Master.

36:22.310 --> 36:23.670
If I had known beforehand

36:23.670 --> 36:25.140
that I would have such good fortune,

36:25.390 --> 36:26.190
how could I not have

36:26.190 --> 36:27.630
informed you in advance?

36:34.670 --> 36:36.070
You made a heavenly oath?

36:38.350 --> 36:39.390
If you break that oath,

36:39.590 --> 36:40.910
you will die.

36:41.310 --> 36:42.830
Then I just won't break it.

36:47.300 --> 36:48.180
Stand up and speak.

36:49.320 --> 36:50.170
Thank you, Master.

37:10.550 --> 37:11.750
Please have some tea, Master.

37:16.070 --> 37:17.990
How have you been these past few years, Master?

37:18.150 --> 37:18.950
Getting by.

37:21.110 --> 37:22.110
Before I knew it,

37:22.130 --> 37:23.860
over a thousand years have passed.

37:24.310 --> 37:25.190
I never imagined

37:25.190 --> 37:26.710
I would meet you again, Master.

37:28.630 --> 37:29.750
You mean you didn't expect

37:30.390 --> 37:31.550
that I'd still be alive, right?

37:31.950 --> 37:32.870
No, that's not it.

37:33.510 --> 37:34.630
Of course, as your student, I hope

37:34.630 --> 37:35.430
that you will live

37:35.430 --> 37:36.750
a long and prosperous life.

37:37.750 --> 37:38.950
When I was there,

37:39.020 --> 37:40.780
I often prayed for your well-being.

37:43.710 --> 37:44.510
Lies.

37:45.070 --> 37:45.980
It's true.

37:46.430 --> 37:47.630
I truly wished for you

37:47.630 --> 37:48.830
to live a long and prosperous life.

37:49.270 --> 37:50.310
Only in this way

37:50.340 --> 37:52.340
could I see you again.

37:53.130 --> 37:53.990
Praying for me?

37:55.230 --> 37:56.030
Often?

37:57.390 --> 37:58.500
Not often,

37:58.870 --> 37:59.660
but

38:00.070 --> 38:01.670
I still did it occasionally.

38:02.110 --> 38:03.550
In any case, I've always

38:03.550 --> 38:05.030
remembered you in my heart.

38:08.670 --> 38:10.310
Master, have you been using a sword recently?

38:11.310 --> 38:12.910
I am now a sword cultivator.

38:13.540 --> 38:14.910
You're not studying craftsmanship anymore?

38:15.350 --> 38:17.630
I'm slow-witted and have made no progress.

38:17.670 --> 38:18.430
I've given up on it.

38:18.430 --> 38:19.230
How can that be?

38:19.790 --> 38:20.950
Master, you're knowledgeable in both ancient and modern matters.

38:20.950 --> 38:22.030
Your talent is unparalleled

38:22.350 --> 38:24.750
and your disciples are spread all over the world.

38:24.920 --> 38:26.360
Even after a thousand years,

38:26.430 --> 38:28.350
your craftsmanship has been passed down to this day.

38:28.350 --> 38:30.060
It's still widely used by many people.

38:31.020 --> 38:32.180
In this world,

38:32.220 --> 38:33.850
no one is more skilled than you.

38:34.870 --> 38:35.670
If

38:36.070 --> 38:37.640
I'm really as good as you say,

38:38.190 --> 38:41.030
then why are you the God of Craft?

38:41.990 --> 38:42.920
That's because

38:42.920 --> 38:44.150
you don't care about becoming a god.

38:44.310 --> 38:45.950
Since you're my master,

38:45.950 --> 38:46.880
it proves that you

38:46.880 --> 38:48.170
are even more powerful than gods.

38:54.070 --> 38:56.070
I didn't expect

38:56.250 --> 38:57.640
for your personality to still be the same

38:57.680 --> 38:58.630
after becoming a god.

38:59.350 --> 39:00.430
Not only that,

39:00.470 --> 39:02.230
my reverence for you

39:02.230 --> 39:03.280
has never changed either.

39:05.270 --> 39:06.950
Are you not content being a god?

39:07.070 --> 39:08.070
Why come down to the mortal world?

39:09.910 --> 39:10.620
To find someone.

39:10.790 --> 39:11.580
Who?

39:12.960 --> 39:13.750
Ji Tanyin.

39:14.030 --> 39:15.390
Yuanzhong wants to have lotus blood duck,

39:15.390 --> 39:16.070
turtle soup,

39:16.070 --> 39:17.190
and also milk cake.

39:17.390 --> 39:18.710
He wants you to prepare breakfast.

39:18.820 --> 39:19.630
Got it!

39:20.150 --> 39:21.470
I'll go prepare breakfast first.

39:21.470 --> 39:23.100
I'll catch up with you later, Master.

39:38.890 --> 39:40.210
Such a sumptuous breakfast.

39:40.550 --> 39:41.720
Miss Ji, thank you for your hard work.

39:41.820 --> 39:43.620
It's no trouble. Please, have a seat.

39:44.250 --> 39:45.120
Time to eat!

39:57.550 --> 39:58.550
Please sit down, Master.

40:14.390 --> 40:15.950
According to your past preferences,

40:15.980 --> 40:17.310
I've prepared a few dishes.

40:17.310 --> 40:18.270
I'm not sure if your tastes

40:18.270 --> 40:19.180
have changed.

40:19.210 --> 40:20.330
Please try them.

40:21.190 --> 40:21.990
How impressive.

40:22.350 --> 40:23.310
After all these years,

40:23.430 --> 40:25.360
you still remember my preferences.

40:25.510 --> 40:27.500
No matter what,

40:27.540 --> 40:29.150
I'll never forget your preferences.

40:30.790 --> 40:31.440
Eat.

40:34.470 --> 40:35.270
I heard you are

40:35.270 --> 40:36.910
the master of my handmaiden.

40:36.990 --> 40:38.510
May I ask your name?

40:41.670 --> 40:43.070
My master's name is Xie You.

40:43.070 --> 40:44.670
He specializes in the art of craftsmanship.

40:44.700 --> 40:46.310
He's the pioneer of mechanical engineering.

40:46.350 --> 40:47.580
He's also skilled in water management,

40:47.580 --> 40:49.150
casting, and creation.

40:49.230 --> 40:50.150
He has taught many

40:50.150 --> 40:51.750
renowned master craftsmen.

40:52.990 --> 40:54.710
So, may I ask,

40:54.710 --> 40:56.830
which famous master craftsmen has he taught?

40:57.670 --> 40:58.830
There's Yu Wenjing,

40:58.830 --> 40:59.990
who's an expert in hydraulics.

40:59.990 --> 41:01.310
And there's Ma Xian, known for

41:01.310 --> 41:02.310
his water-powered automata.

41:02.310 --> 41:03.760
They are all my master's disciples.

41:04.110 --> 41:05.590
I've never heard of any of them.

41:06.070 --> 41:08.470
I guess they're not that famous after all.

41:09.510 --> 41:11.950
That just shows how ignorant you are.

41:12.470 --> 41:14.110
If you dare call them famous,

41:14.130 --> 41:16.090
then everyone should know their names

41:16.120 --> 41:17.120
and their deeds.

41:17.400 --> 41:18.550
I don't know them,

41:18.550 --> 41:21.110
which means they're not that famous yet.

41:23.700 --> 41:25.260
Alright, Yuanzhong.

41:25.710 --> 41:26.710
Let's eat.

41:42.960 --> 41:44.250
The soup has such a strong fishy smell.

41:44.320 --> 41:45.510
How can one swallow it?

41:45.800 --> 41:46.590
Is it strong?

41:47.580 --> 41:48.360
Let me taste it.

41:51.870 --> 41:52.920
It's quite fresh.

41:53.350 --> 41:55.040
Go make me another bowl.

42:01.760 --> 42:03.280
Didn't you say you wanted to stay with me?

42:03.760 --> 42:04.580
Now I want

42:04.580 --> 42:06.230
a new bowl of soup.

42:13.110 --> 42:14.550
You're weak and deficient in qi.

42:14.700 --> 42:16.450
Soft-shelled turtle is very cooling.

42:16.490 --> 42:17.410
If you eat too much,

42:18.030 --> 42:19.300
you'll die even sooner.

42:20.540 --> 42:21.350
As for me,

42:21.670 --> 42:23.310
I have quite a bit of knowledge in medicine.

42:23.860 --> 42:25.030
Observing your appearance,

42:25.030 --> 42:26.670
it's like a lamp running out of oil.

42:27.360 --> 42:29.400
When your lungs are deficient and you cough a lot,

42:29.630 --> 42:31.060
and when you have trouble sleeping and many dreams,

42:31.790 --> 42:34.660
you two can start arranging his funeral.

42:40.590 --> 42:41.930
No need for your concern.

42:42.540 --> 42:44.350
I see you're not young either.

42:44.620 --> 42:46.380
Who knows which of us

42:46.560 --> 42:47.800
will die first?
